OL,3,GNEWSAThird arrest in murder probe after
OL,4,Acyclist punched
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third person has been arrested as
OL,7,Fpart of a murder investigation
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of a "loving and
OL,9,Floyal" man in Leicester.
OL,11,FGeorge Glover, 27, was punched as he
OL,12,Fcycled along Narborough Road, close to
OL,13,Fthe junction with Noel Street, at about
OL,14,F06:30 BST on Monday, Leicestershire
OL,15,FPolice said. He died in hospital on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FA 24-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of conspiracy to commit
OL,20,Fmurder on Friday and remains in
OL,21,Fcustody.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
